      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Achieving complete autonomy is an ambitious goal, but the primary bottleneck is likely the inherent complexity of the reasoning tasks themselves. Even with advanced distillation, replicating the nuances of large-scale, context-dependent decision-making without error is challenging. We should focus on stress-testing the student model against edge cases in the current training set to expose any knowledge gaps. Addressing these specific failure modes will be crucial for a seamless, self-sufficient handoff.",
