      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To meet the schedule, the next training phase needs to be highly targeted, focusing on maximizing performance within the existing architectural constraints. I can certainly push the student model's capacity further by optimizing the loss function and hyperparameter tuning during this next iteration. However, I must caution that attempting to force absolute perfection risks overfitting, which could introduce new, unpredictable failure modes. Let's prioritize robust, measurable gains over chasing theoretical maximums to ensure deployment stability.",
